msgctxt "164"
msgid "I'm sorry about the ruckus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "That guy with the backpack looked pretty down in the dumps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Pardon my asking, but are you one of Hirano-san's friends?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Hirano? Who's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"The man I was just speaking with. It looked like he knew you\r\n"
"somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "I found him collapsed in the street earlier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Collapsed in the street!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"That's awful... Creating that masterpiece of his must have\r\n"
"taken its toll on his body..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "No, I think it was because his backpack is too damn heavy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Forget it, it's not important."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"You said something about manga. What's that got to do\r\n"
"with him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Hirano-san's a professional manga artist!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"Or, well... he was going to be a professional manga artist.\r\n"
"I'm not sure he will anymore..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "What's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr "Che cosa vorresti dire?"

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"This week's Shonen Five announced the winners of the\r\n"
"Shonen Five Awards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"One of those winners was Hirano-san, who won the grand\r\n"
"prize in the Young Artist division."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Is that right?"
msgstr "È così?"

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"This week, we ran the winning entries in Shonen Five, but now Hirano-san "
"says he won't draw manga ever again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"I overheard you mentioning his parents. Are they part of\r\n"
"the problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "That seems to be the case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"Apparently, Hirano-san's family is somewhat famous in\r\n"
"Okinawa: they're all brilliant doctors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"Hirano-san himself is studying to be a doctor, too. He's\r\n"
"currently attending medical school at Touto University."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Okinawa? Funny you should say that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"I wish I could go to Okinawa and convince his parents\r\n"
"to let him pursue this dream..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "But I'm afraid that Hirano-san has already given up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "And he comes from a family of doctors in Okinawa, right? Hmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"Hirano-san's got so much talent. As an editor, I can't\r\n"
"let myself give up on someone like him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"It takes one in a million to become a professional manga\r\n"
"artist, and of those, only those who are personally selected."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Hirano-san's talents deserve to be put on display\r\n"
"for the whole world to see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "And his parents are famous doctors in Okinawa... Hmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"Hey, are you even listening to me? You keep going on and on\r\n"
"about that Okinawan doctor thing! What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Oh, sorry."
msgstr "Oh, scusa."

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Truth is, I actually live in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "Wait, really!?"
msgstr "Aspetta, sul serio?"

msgctxt "584"
msgid "That's perfect! Would you come with me to Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Wait, what?"
msgstr "Ma che?"

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"I wanted to go to Okinawa to meet with Hirano-san's parents,\r\n"
"but to be honest, I was too worried to go! I have no idea\r\n"
"what things are like down south!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"I can wait until you go back to Okinawa! Please,\r\n"
"I just need someone to be my guide!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"I know you say you can wait, but I have no idea when I'll\r\n"
"be getting back to Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"That's fine. Until you do, I'm going to spend some time\r\n"
"finding out where Hirano-san's family lives."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "How do you plan on meeting up with me in Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"Hmm, good question. It'd be easiest to meet you on the\r\n"
"main street of Downtown Ryukyu. Is there a good meet-up\r\n"
"place somewhere along that road?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"Let's see. There's the OPA building. That could be a\r\n"
"good spot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid "OPA? Oh, I know what that is! Sounds great!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"Right then, when you get back to Okinawa, meet me in front\r\n"
"of the OPA building! I'll be waiting there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid ""
"Hold on. You're speeding way too fast through this\r\n"
"conversation. No need to rush."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "I've gotta get going now... Oh, right! What's your name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "It's Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "Kiryu-san, got it! I'll see you soon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid ""
"(That editor guy didn't even ask for my cell phone or\r\n"
"anything. At least he's got my name.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "(Hope he'll be okay.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10168"
msgid "Editor"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10172"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

